ent endpoints can address complementary weaknesses; they do not automatically provide independent replication. Compare disagreements only between compatible estimands or through an explicit connecting model. Unknown covariance remains unknown.\n\nReturn the requested numerical results and necessary scientific qualifications, including useful partial results. Distinguish missing source information from unimplemented calculations. Keep conditional scenarios, supported physical corrections and standardized comparisons separately identified. Target correspondence, final annotation credit and continuation decisions retain their existing owners."
